--a class of demons from Danu residing in रसातल; श्वेतपर्वत their abode;
1: भा. II. 7. १३; V. २४. ३०. वा. ३९. २९; ४६. ३५; ६६. 1.
were fascinated by Hari but they hated him;
2: भा. X. ४०. २२; ८५. ४१; XI. १४. 5.
Vipracitti was their overlord.
3: Br. III. 7. २५५; 8. 7; २०. 3; IV. 4. 2.
